OL,3,GNEWSAAlley garden restored after
OL,4,Aclearance mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who were left "devastated"
OL,7,Fafter their community alleyway garden
OL,8,Fwas destroyed in a clearance mix-up
OL,9,Fhave said the neighbourhood has come
OL,10,Ftogether to help grow again.
OL,12,FCouncil contractors ripped out the
OL,13,Fgarden in Levenshulme in Manchester by
OL,14,Fmistake in August, following five years
OL,15,Fof planting and growing by locals.
OL,17,FThey had been responding to a report of
OL,18,Fovergrown vegetation nearby. Both the
OL,19,Fcouncil and the contractors admitted
OL,20,Fthe error and promised to help revive
OL,21,Fthe garden.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
